{"id":27913,"slug":"la-verite","title":"La vérité","year":1960,"country":"France","duration":128,"spine":960,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27913-la-verite","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/11818e83db91f6e4307a6a557d4cf8d2/SY1JhRuHJNtbFE0z2GaXxAJG12O5JA_large.jpg","description":"Beautiful, troubled Dominique Marceau (Brigitte Bardot) came to bohemian Paris to escape the suffocation of provincial life, only to wind up in a courtroom, accused of a terrible crime: the murder of her lover (Sami Frey). As the trial commences and the lawyers begin tangling over Dominique’s fate, Henri-Georges Clouzot’s Oscar-nominated La vérité delves into her past, reconstructing her struggle to find a foothold in the city. What emerges is a nuanced portrait of an impulsive young woman misunderstood and mistreated by those around her, and of her ultimately tragic affair with an up-and-coming conductor. With an astonishing performance by Bardot, Clouzot’s affecting and intricately constructed film—a huge late-career success for the French master—renders a harsh verdict against a hypocritical and moralistic society.Restored by Sony Pictures Entertainment in partnership with The Film Foundation and RT Features.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Henri-Georges Clouzot","slug":"henri-georges-clouzot"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Brigitte Bardot","role":"Dominique Marceau","slug":"brigitte-bardot"},{"actor":"Paul Meurisse","role":"Éparvier","slug":"paul-meurisse"},{"actor":"Charles Vanel","role":"Guérin","slug":"charles-vanel"},{"actor":"Sami Frey","role":"Gilbert Tellier","slug":"sami-frey"},{"actor":"Marie-José Nat","role":"Annie Marceau","slug":"marie-jose-nat"},{"actor":"Louis Seigner","role":"President of the court","slug":"louis-seigner"},{"actor":"Jean-Loup Reynold","role":"Michel","slug":"jean-loup-reynold"},{"actor":"André Oumansky","role":"Ludovic","slug":"andre-oumansky"},{"actor":"Claude Berri","role":"Georges","slug":"claude-berri"},{"actor":"